    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <img class="seal" src="/assets/img/mia-seal-dark.png" alt="Molosser International Association seal, established 2020" width="280" height="280">
  </div>
  <p class="lead-dark">MIA was founded by breeders, for breeders. We believe a registration should mean something: verified parentage, documented health, and dogs that meet a real standard of type and function. By pairing DNA-verified pedigrees with hands-on appraisal and required health testing, MIA gives breeders and buyers a record they can trust, for every dog in the registry.</p>
</section>

